# Security Rules

- All config via `Settings`; never log `SecretStr` values.
- No `.env.local` contents in generated code or commits.
- Parameterized SQL only; no string-interpolated queries.
- `check_sensitivity` runs before any cloud LLM call (Phase 3+).
- RBAC at tool decorators: manager < analyst < admin.
- Red Zone — propose changes; require human review before merge.
